    <string name="dev_link_body">Wuxuu muujiyaa gelinta TV-ga iyo dhammaan abkiisa, wuxuu beddelaa gelinta TV-yada aan aqbalin badhamada HDMI, qaarkoodna wuxuu u dejiyaa iftiinka. Wuxuu ku shaqeeyaa xidhiidhka debugging ee TV-ga (ADB). Badhamada iyo qoraalku sidoodii bay u shaqeeyaan la\'aantiis.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_connect">Ku xidh</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off">TV-gu wuu diiday xidhiidhka. Hubi in USB debugging shidan yahay. Laga soo bilaabo Android TV 14, TV-yada qaar waxay aqbalaan Wireless debugging oo keliya, taas oo TennaRC aanu weli isticmaali karin.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_debugging_off_short">Debugging-ku waa ka dansan yahay TV-ga</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten">TV-gu wuu ilaaway taleefankan, sida Android TV ku sameeyo qalab uusan arag toddobaad. Isku day mar kale, oo ku oggolow TV-ga.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_forgotten_short">TV-gu wuu ilaaway taleefankan</string>
