    <string name="dev_link_step_debugging">Fur Developer options, oo ku xiga About, kadibna shid USB debugging. Shield-ka waa Network debugging.</string>
    <string name="dev_link_step_developer">TV-ga ka fur Settings › System › About oo dooro Android TV OS build toddoba jeer. TV-yada duugga ah waa Device Preferences › About › Build.</string>
